<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble falls to 15,500 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble falls to 15,500 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble slipped to 15,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 14,650 on the previous session.</p>
<p>				    September 20	  September 19</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,500		  14,650</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $7.441 million	    $2.575 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
